{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19294","headline":"和东川王相公新涨驿池八韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"和东川王相公新涨驿池八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日池塘上，初移造物权。\n苞藏成别岛，沿浊致清涟。\n变化生言下，蓬瀛落眼前。\n泛觞惊翠羽，开幕对红莲。\n远写风光入，明含气象全。\n渚烟笼驿树，波日漾宝筵。\n曲岸留缇骑，中流转彩船。\n无因接元礼，共载比神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}